{"lang": "html", "code": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"es\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>HBO's Lanterns | Green Lantern Corps</title>\n    <style>\n        :root {\n            --bg-color: #030a06;\n            --card-bg: #07160d;\n            --green-primary: #00ff66;\n            --green-glow: rgba(0, 255, 102, 0.3);\n            --text-main: #e2fcd9;\n            --text-muted: #8ca884;\n        }\n\n        * {\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n        }\n\n        body {\n            background-color: var(--bg-color);\n            color: var(--text-main);\n            background-image: \n                radial-gradient(circle at 50% 20%, rgba(0, 80, 30, 0.15) 0%, transparent 50%),\n                radial-gradient(circle at 10% 80%, rgba(0, 255, 102, 0.05) 0%, transparent 40%);\n            min-height: 100vh;\n            padding: 2rem 1rem;\n        }\n\n        header {\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-bottom: 3rem;\n            padding: 0 1rem;\n        }\n\n        h1 {\n            font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);\n            letter-spacing: 4px;\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n            color: var(--green-primary);\n            text-shadow: 0 0 20px var(--green-glow), 0 0 40px rgba(0, 255, 102, 0.1);\n            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n        }\n\n        header p {\n            color: var(--text-muted);\n            font-size: 1.1rem;\n            letter-spacing: 2px;\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n        }\n\n        .container {\n            max-width: 1400px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n\n        .grid {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));\n            gap: 2rem;\n        }\n\n        .card {\n            background-color: var(--card-bg);\n            border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 102, 0.2);\n            border-radius: 12px;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease;\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n        }\n\n        .card:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-8px);\n            border-color: var(--green-primary);\n            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px var(--green-glow);\n        }\n\n        .card-img-wrapper {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 220px;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            position: relative;\n        }\n\n        .card-img-wrapper::after {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            bottom: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 40px;\n            background: linear-gradient(to top, var(--card-bg), transparent);\n        }\n\n        .card img {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            object-fit: cover;\n            transition: transform 0.5s ease;\n        }\n\n        .card:hover img {\n            transform: scale(1.05);\n        }\n\n        .card-content {\n            padding: 1.5rem;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            flex-grow: 1;\n        }\n\n        .card-title {\n            font-size: 1.25rem;\n            color: var(--green-primary);\n            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            letter-spacing: 1px;\n        }\n\n        .card-desc {\n            font-size: 0.95rem;\n            color: var(--text-muted);\n            line-height: 1.5;\n            flex-grow: 1;\n        }\n\n        footer {\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-top: 4rem;\n            color: var(--text-muted);\n            font-size: 0.85rem;\n            letter-spacing: 1px;\n            border-top: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 102, 0.1);\n            padding-top: 2rem;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n    <header>\n        <h1>HBO's Lanterns</h1>\n        <p>In brightest day, in blackest night...</p>\n    </header>\n\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"grid\">\n            <div class=\"card\">\n                <div class=\"card-img-wrapper\">\n                    <img src=\"https://ew.com/thmb/G9S0KI1akhAIHSpUQ4WbDtPceAg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/Aaron-Pierre-Green-Lantern-John-Stewart-092724-73eab74d28e04e4fafd608e13e803a0b.jpg\" alt=\"John Stewart First Look\">\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"card-content\">\n                    <h2 class=\"card-title\">El Legado de John Stewart</h2>\n                    <p class=\"card-desc\">Aaron Pierre encabeza la serie interpretando al icónico Linterna Verde en una producción de alto voltaje para HBO.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"card\">\n                <div class=\"card-img-wrapper\">\n                    <img src=\"https://www.vitalthrills.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/lanternsheader.jpg\" alt=\"Lanterns Header Art\">\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"card-content\">\n                    <h2 class=\"card-title\">El Cuerpo de Linternas</h2>\n                    <p class=\"card-desc\">Una mirada al vasto universo de los protectores intergalácticos bajo la visión estética de DC Studios y HBO.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"card\">\n                <div class=\"card-img-wrapper\">\n                    <img src=\"https://media.ambito.com/p/fe9fa6e7498aa1d28b152bb4aa6e085c/adjuntos/239/imagenes/042/218/0042218502/lanternsjpg.jpg\" alt=\"Production Still\">\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"card-content\">\n                    <h2 class=\"card-title\">Secretos del Sector 2814</h2>\n                    <p class=\"card-desc\">Investigaciones oscuras y misterios cósmicos se entrelazan en esta ambiciosa serie dramática de detectives espaciales.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"card\">\n                <div class=\"card-img-wrapper\">\n                    <img src=\"https://fwmedia.fandomwire.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/02210726/kyle-chandler-aaron-pierre-green-lantern.jpg?width=1400&height=788&fit=crop&format=auto&sharpen=true&quality=70\" alt=\"Kyle Chandler and Aaron Pierre\">\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"card-content\">\n                    <h2 class=\"card-title\">Veteranos y Novatos</h2>\n                    <p class=\"card-desc\">La dinámica entre Hal Jordan y John Stewart formará el núcleo emocional y de mentoría en el corazón del cuerpo.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"card\">\n                <div class=\"card-img-wrapper\">\n                    <img src=\"https://bleedingfool.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/aaron-pierre-green-lantern-corps-john-stewart.webp\" alt=\"Aaron Pierre close up\">\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"card-content\">\n                    <h2 class=\"card-title\">La Voluntad Inquebrantable</h2>\n                    <p class=\"card-desc\">Detalle de la caracterización y el porte imponente que define la nueva era de los héroes espaciales en la televisión.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"card\">\n                <div class=\"card-img-wrapper\">\n                    <img src=\"https://townsquare.media/site/442/files/2024/10/attachment-Green-Lantern-tv-stewart.jpg?w=780&q=75\" alt=\"TV Series Teaser\">\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"card-content\">\n                    <h2 class=\"card-title\">Amenazas Ocultas</h2>\n                    <p class=\"card-desc\">Un thriller terrenal con escala galáctica que pondrá a prueba la verdadera fuerza del anillo energético.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"card\">\n                <div class=\"card-img-wrapper\">\n                    <img src=\"https://entertainment.inquirer.net/files/2024/10/Screenshot-2024-10-14-at-12.58.49 PM-1200x754.png\" alt=\"Series Announcement\">\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"card-content\">\n                    <h2 class=\"card-title\">Un Nuevo Amanecer</h2>\n                    <p class=\"card-desc\">El universo DC cobra vida en la pantalla chica con una calidad cinematográfica sin precedentes para la señal de HBO.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <footer>\n        <p>&copy; DC Studios / HBO. Todos los derechos reservados. Hecho con el poder del Anillo de Poder.</p>\n    </footer>\n\n</body>\n</html>"}